I didn't!

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:09.710
You did! How dirty.

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:10.960
You...

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:15.130
Lala-sama, good morning!

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:17.210
Peke! You got up so late! {gamma- orig: "too late!" | changed to "so late!" | it isn't definite at this point that they are late}

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.920
