00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:20.800
Sure. {gamma- orig: Alright. | alright alright alright alright alright etc}

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:29.100
You two! If you don't eat quickly, you're going to be late!

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:30.640
Okay!{I hate this. Hai doesnt mean Yes every single time}{gamma: here Kanade I'll change it for you then}

