00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:59.150
What?

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.360
Because, look...

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:01.860
This place.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:09.620
A year ago... I left my home on Deviluke. {gamma- I don't think a comma can be used for a 2 second pause so I put ...}

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:16.080
