00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:26.380
Then who were you saying it to? {gamma- changed to "it" from "that," we already know what "that" is from the previous line}

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:29.680
Never mind.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:34.730
Anyway, there's something I have to make clear to you. {Anyway, I have to make it clear with you on something}

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:36.310
Something to make clear to me?

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.650
Yup!{added this -masat}

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:42.440
I feel that this is the most appropriate place to tell you. {gamma- present tense. she is saying it very soon so she feels this way, not felt}

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:43.780
What?

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:46.740
I...

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.570
...like you, Rito.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:53.830
I like you the most in the entire universe.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:06:01.540
So from now on, I have to do my best to make you like me as well!

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:07.930
Alright, let's go!

