We're going to be late!

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:13.510
Hey, there's no way we'll make it on time!

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:15.470
Alright then...

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:19.600
Tada! Pyon-Pyon Warp-kun - Improved!{Kai? Or not? -masat}{Yup, kai - ZY}

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:20.480
Hey, that's...

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:21.610
It's fine!

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:24.570
I've totally fixed all the problems it had before!

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:26.360
Really?

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:27.280
Yep!

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:30.740
[Sainan High School]

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:30.740
