It's great, isn't it?

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.390
Hey!

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:03.480
Isn't it the same as before if it still doesn't warp your clothes as well?

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.820
Oh my! How daring!

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:09.530
What are you up to so early in the morning?

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:11.320
Lala-chi, good morning!

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:12.660
Morning!

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:13.780
T-That's...

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.620
Is that what you call an "out of body" experience?

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:19.660
No, it's not like that!

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:22.330
Naked... Lala-chan's naked body...

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.590
Hey! Stop looking!

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:25.630
Unforgivable!

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:28.130
How dare you stand out more than me! {gamma: stand out is two words}

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:31.930
Rito... For my sake...

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:34.430
Boobs... Boobs... Boobs!{where does this belong? -masat}

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:35.430
Rito! I love you!

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:37.010
Don't! Let me go!

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:38.020
Rito...

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:40.600
How shameless.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:08:00.160
Motto To LOVE-Ru 02

00:07:56.240 --> 00:08:00.160
<u>War at the Baths</u>

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:02.290
Eh? Yami-chan?

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:05.540
What a coincidence to meet you at a place like this!

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:07.090
Good evening, Yami-san!

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.090
Hello!

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:13.220
Rito! Hurry up and go in!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.430
Sure.

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:21.680
[Poka Poka Hotsprings]

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:28.230
As I thought, a larger bath feels much better.

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:30.030
Wow, it's so fun here!{I timed this whole "Wah it's so fun here" or whatever line -masat}

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:32.150
There are all sorts of baths here!

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:33.530
You're right!

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:43.460
Hey, it's a sand bath!

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.040
Let's go over there and have a look!

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.130
Lala-san, wait!

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:53.720
But I'm surprised that you come here regularly, Yami-san.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.930
The facilities here aren't too bad, so I occasionally come and use them.{joined these -masat}

00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:59.180
I see.

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:03.310
Hey, why don't we go and try out the other baths?

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:06.020
No thanks, I'm fine.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:09.110
Why did she say that?

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:12.400
If it's like that, I'll never get to know her better.

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:14.610
Yuuki Mikan.

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:17.610
Why so formal? Mikan is fine.

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:22.450
You shouldn't get too familiar with me.

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.460
It's for both our sakes.

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.040
Oh! Yami-san, wait!

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:39.680
I've found you, Golden Darkness!

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:42.430
Yami-chan! Mikan! Are you alright?

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:43.890
Yami-san...

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:50.440
What do you want with me?

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:53.400
Isn't that obvious? I'm here to hunt the prey.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:56.900
Because we're both bounty hunters.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:01.580
Yuuki-kun?

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.580
Why are you walking in so openly?{dignified}

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.540
That guy has been fitted with a body control device.

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:09.580
He'll do whatever I want him to do.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:12.630
I can't control myself. How's that possible?! {gamma- orig: "I'm can't" changed to "I can't" for obvious reasons}

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:16.760
This guy is the only target left yet to be destroyed.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.880
Looks like I'm in for a great show. {gamma- orig: great watch, he's a bad guy, he wants to say great show, trust me}

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:20.220
The antenna...

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:22.430
Explosives have been fitted on it.

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:25.770
If you forcibly remove it, the guy's toast.

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:30.270
Yami-san!

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:32.270
Yami!

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.480
So it's really true!

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.940
This guy is your comrade, right?

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:40.280
That's why you won't make a move, Golden Darkness.

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:43.620
Quit spouting nonsense!

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:48.790
He's been my target all along.

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:50.960
I'm just letting him live, for now.

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:52.210
Yami-san.

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:54.840
I'm going to try and find the guy controlling Rito.

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:57.300
Please step back, Yuuki Mikan.

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:01.430
This is my problem as an assassin.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:03.640
I will resolve this by myself.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.140
You're saying things like that again!

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:08.140
If you act like that, you'll be alone forever.

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:11.520
You should rely on your friends a little.

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.690
Friends...

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:23.120
Ow...

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.870
You scared the hell out of me...

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:31.960
So, it's true that bitch Golden Darkness really has no intention of killing Yuuki Rito.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:34.790
Are you alright, Yuuki-kun?

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.590
Sairenji?

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:38.420
No, no, it's not me!

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:39.970
No!

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.840
Hey! Stop that right now!

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:44.010
Don't get in the way!

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:49.060
Small boobs are nice, but big boobs aren't bad either!

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:52.850
Bro, have you forgotten the original objective?

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:54.730
Wait, my objective is-

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:57.020
Golden Darkness's naked body!

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:59.110
I hate perverts!

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:02.150
Shit! I can't see!

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:10.330
Bro, I never thought you were this perverted!

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.080
Eh? What're you on about?

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.830
I can't go on anymore.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:20.050
What're you saying? We have been through so much...

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:21.380
What, what?

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:23.880
Yami-san, they're here!

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:25.180
Yami-san!

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:25.180
Shit!

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:27.510
Yuuki, come here quickly and protect us!

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:28.970
It's a waste of effort.

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:32.680
When it comes to machines, no one can match up to Lala-sama.

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:36.980
Hehe! I made a remote control that can emit a stronger signal.

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:37.810
What?

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:39.900
Alright. Go, Rito!

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.900
Why are you controlling me?!

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:45.910
It's fine! I've already fitted an acceleration system, so I won't lose!

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:51.580
Amazing...

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:54.460
I didn't even get a chance to make a move.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:56.790
Sorry for troubling you, Princess.

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:58.250
It's fine, it's fine!

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:59.710
Right, Rito?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:02.630
But I'm not fine...

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:05.260
As expected of Lala-san, right?

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:08.600
Looks like I didn't do much to help after all.

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:10.600
That's not true.

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:13.060
You were the one who discovered the location of the enemy.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:17.810
Thank you... Mikan.

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.070
You're too formal!

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:37.620
Motto To LOVE-Ru 03

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:37.620
<u>The Sound of Ticking Love</u>

