00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:54.180
Shh! You're too loud, Risa!

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:02.520
It is against the rules to bring unnecessary items into school!

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:03.820
Two points deducted!

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:04.940
No way!

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:08.990
Yui... That should be alright...

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:13.240
Your skirt is 1 cm too short.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.500
You're not wearing a necktie either. Two points deducted!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:19.330
Wait... 1 cm too short should be acceptable, right?

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:22.960
Hey Rito, check out my new invention!

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:24.170
If you press this button...

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:27.800
You lose points for using suspicious items at school too!

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.010
Confiscated!

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:30.180
Eh?

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:35.100
Kotegawa, it's dangerous if you hold on to things like that.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:37.480
It's Lala's invention after all.

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:38.640
Yuuki-kun.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:42.230
You should watch out too.

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.570
If I catch you doing anything shameless,

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:47.360
I'll be deducting ten points straightaway!

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:52.950
Something shameless...

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:59.750
How is it, Aya, Rin?

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:02.080
It's wonderful, Saki-sama.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:07.590
This dress will definitely steal Zastin-sama's heart.

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:11.260
What are you doing in that getup? {gamma- changed get-up to getup}

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:13.760
Oh my! Do you have any complaints?{monku means complain. You have any complaints?}{gamma- changed from "What's your opinion," thanks kanade}

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:16.430
Wearing something other than your school uniform is against the rules!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:19.100
The school rules?

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:24.610
In front of my heart filled with love, the school rules are but a hazy illusion!

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:26.400
The school rules are the school rules!

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:29.190
No need to raise your voice...

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:33.990
Or perhaps... you have never fallen in love before?

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:40.000
People who have yet to fall in love will never understand my feelings!

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.380
Love...

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:46.840
That's shameless.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:50.420
For now...

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:56.050
Come! Come a little closer!

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:57.930
Points deducted!

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:00.930
Honestly...

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:05.150
There are so many problems with students today!

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:10.570
Why can't everyone get on with life normally?

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:14.410
Eh? Kotegawa?

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:16.370
Yuuki-kun.

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:21.040
Points will be deducted if you're loitering around after school.

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:24.000
Er no, I'm here to get something I forgot to take with me.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:27.000
I see. Then it's fine.

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:36.010
Is that a list of all the people you've deducted points from?

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:38.260
Yeah.

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:45.310
Hey, isn't it better for you to take some of the load off your shoulders?

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:46.150
Huh?

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:50.650
Everything you say might always be right.

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:53.450
But if that's all you do, don't you get tired?

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:56.070
W-What's this, all of a sudden?

00:16:56.070 --> 00:17:00.240
I can't believe that a delinquent like you is saying this.

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:07.000
Alright, see you tomorrow.

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:07.000
Oh yeah, this...

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.110
Bye.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:31.320
Bye.

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:34.900
Um... May I call you Yami-chan?

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:39.410
You are Koge... Kogegawa Yui?

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:40.660
It's Kotegawa!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:42.990
Oh yeah.

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:49.960
You're always reading books, aren't you?

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:53.420
Because literature from Earth is very interesting.

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:03.640
Love always happens without warning.

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:09.150
At that time, the gears of fate will start spinning.

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:14.690
Just like the hands on a clock, two people's hearts will separate and meet again.

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:16.650
Eventually they reunite.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:20.200
What's this all of a sudden?

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:22.740
I just read the first page of a romance novel.

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:25.000
Kotegawa Yui.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:27.410
Are you in love right now?

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:31.130
I have no interest in things like that! {tsuntsun}

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:33.130
Why are you asking me that?

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:36.010
The feeling of love...

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:40.050
No matter how I think about it, I just can't understand it.

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:44.060
If it's possible, I'd like to know,

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:47.890
because it seems to be an important feeling.

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:55.900
Yami-chan! For something like that... You should ask me!

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:08.540
Jeez... What was that, all of a sudden?

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:18.420
Jeez...

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:24.800
Kotegawa, you're here to avoid the rain too?

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:27.430
Yuuki-kun!?{so moe~}{indeed}

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:39.030
Oh yeah...

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:41.110
What?

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:46.160
Er...

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:52.170
U-Use my handkerchief!

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:54.170
Thanks.

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.100
Yuuki-kun.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:15.360
Give this back to Lala-san.

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:20.490
I was going to give it back to her after class,

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:22.110
but I didn't get a chance to. {lit: My timing wasn't right}

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:24.030
Alright.

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:28.580
Kotegawa!

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:35.170
S-Stop! This sudden...

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:36.290
No!

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:49.720
Be quiet.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:53.100
E-Even if you say that...

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:55.480
My heart's not ready...

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:59.440
If we don't keep quiet, we'll be found.

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:07.200
Even though I made Yami-chan hate me, I found an awesome book!

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:14.500
That scared me!

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:20.710
Idiot!

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:23.760
Hey!

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:25.630
Why...

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:32.430
I just don't get Kotegawa!

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:45.110
Why does my heart beat so fast when I'm with that shameless guy?

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:00.960
8 points deducted!

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:20.980
<b>itsumo no jikan ni machiawasete</b>

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:20.980
<b>いつもの時間に待ち合わせて</b>

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:20.980
<b>I'm waiting for you at the usual time,</b>

00:22:20.980 --> 00:22:23.900
<b>chikoku shite terekakushi</b>

00:22:20.980 --> 00:22:23.900
<b>遅刻して照れ隠し</b>

00:22:20.980 --> 00:22:23.900
<b>Hiding my embarrassment because I'm late.</b>

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:28.030
<b>damari komi kimete aruki dasuno</b>

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:28.030
<b>黙りこみ決めて歩き出すの</b>

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:28.030
<b>I walk beside you without saying a word.</b>

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:30.660
<b>share ni nattenai!</b>

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:30.660
<b>シャレになってない!</b>

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:30.660
<b>This joke is not funny.</b>

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:37.120
<b>yume ni miteta koto konya kanai sou</b>

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:37.120
<b>夢に見てたこと 今夜叶いそう</b>

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:37.120
<b>What I saw in the dream might come true tonight.</b>

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:43.170
<b>dakedo ne watashi kara janaku</b>

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:43.170
<b>だけどね 私からじゃなく</b>

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:43.170
<b>But you know, it shouldn't come from me.</b>

00:22:43.170 --> 00:22:50.220
<b>anata no yuuki de kime naku cha</b>

00:22:43.170 --> 00:22:50.220
<b>あなたの勇気でキメなくちゃ</b>

00:22:43.170 --> 00:22:50.220
<b>I need you to pluck up the courage to decide.</b>

00:22:50.760 --> 00:22:57.390
<b>koishiteru kono kanji</b>

00:22:50.760 --> 00:22:57.390
<b>恋してる この感じ</b>

00:22:50.760 --> 00:22:57.390
<b>Falling in love... This feeling...</b>

00:22:57.890 --> 00:23:05.110
<b>romanchikkuna yume wo misasete</b>

00:22:57.890 --> 00:23:05.110
<b>ロマンチックな夢を見させて</b>

00:22:57.890 --> 00:23:05.110
<b>Lets us witness romantic sweet dreams.</b>

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:13.410
<b>koishiteru kono omoi kokoro kara</b>

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:13.410
<b>恋してる この想い 心から</b>

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:13.410
<b>Falling in love... This feeling in my heart...</b>

00:23:13.410 --> 00:23:21.330
<b>afure dashiteru baby love</b>

00:23:13.410 --> 00:23:21.330
<b>溢れ出してる baby love</b>

00:23:13.410 --> 00:23:21.330
<b>...is overflowing with baby love.</b>

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:40.980
Preview

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:40.980
Preview

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:33.180
Yahoo! I'm Lala.

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:35.900
It's really comfortable on Rito's bed.

00:23:35.900 --> 00:23:38.220
Rito's sleeping face is really cute. It's great!

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:40.980
Let's sleep together tonight, Rito!
